&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Nonprofit Account Executive at Anthropic, you&#39;ll drive adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic partnerships with nonprofit organizations. You&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to nonprofit leaders, helping them embed and deploy AI to amplify their impact across program delivery, fundraising, research, and operations. In collaboration with GTM, Product, and Marketing teams, you&#39;ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to ensure differentiated value across the nonprofit landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be an exceptional salesperson with a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products in the nonprofit sector, you will help organizations amplify their social impact while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic within nonprofit organizations. Find your way to the right people at prospective customers, educate them about LLMs, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You&#39;ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to launch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyze market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities, partnerships, and campaigns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spearhead market expansion by pinpointing new customer segments and use cases within nonprofit program departments, development offices, research centers, and administrative functions. Collaborate cross-functionally to differen

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Public Sector Account Executive to drive the adoption of safe, frontier AI across governments in Southeast Asia, establishing and growing Anthropic&#39;s presence in this strategic region. Based in Singapore, you&#39;ll leverage your consultative sales expertise and deep understanding of public sector landscapes across ASEAN markets to grow revenue while becoming a trusted partner to government customers, helping them embed and deploy AI and uncover its full range of capabilities. Working with ministries, statutory boards, and agencies across the region, you&#39;ll navigate diverse procurement, security, and compliance environments to build long-term strategic partnerships. In collaboration with GTM, product, policy, and marketing teams, you&#39;ll help define our market entry strategy and value proposition for public sector customers across ASEAN.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Anthropic&#39;s market entry and expansion across ASEAN public sector markets, building relationships with key stakeholders across ministries, statutory boards, and government agencies in Singapore and throughout the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle for public sector opportunities across ASEAN, from initial outreach through to successful deployment, with a focus on building long-term strategic partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate the procurement requirements, security standards, and compliance frameworks specific to government technology adoption in each market—including GeBIZ procurement and IM8 security requirements in Singapore—and prioritise markets based on opportunity and readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with policy teams to ensure alignment with national AI strategies and digital government initiatives across the region, such as Singapore&#39;s National AI Strategy and Smart Nation programme and the ASEAN Guide on AI Govern

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Startups Account Executive at Anthropic, you’ll drive adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with some of the fastest growing startups in the world. You’ll leverage your consultative sales expertise to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to customers, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities. In collaboration with GTM, product, and marketing teams, you’ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to ensure differentiated value across the landscape.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products, you will help enterprises obtain new capabilities while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic. Find your way to the right people at prospective customers, educate them about LLMs, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You’ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyze market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities, partnerships, and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by pinpointing new customer segments and use cases. Collaborate cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings and sustain a competitive edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering customer feedback and conveying market needs. Provide insights that strengthen our value proposition and enhance the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine the sales methodol

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As one of the founding Startup Account Executives in EMEA, you’ll pioneer the adoption of safe, frontier AI across the region by securing strategic deals with some of the fastest growing technology companies in the world. You’ll leverage your consultative sales expertise to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to customers, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities. In collaboration with GTM, product, and marketing teams, you’ll build Anthropic&#39;s presence across EMEA&#39;s dynamic startup ecosystem, continuously refining our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to ensure differentiated value across the landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. As an early member of our EMEA sales team, you&#39;ll help establish Anthropic&#39;s commercial foundation in the region while advancing the ethical development of AI technology.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic. Find your way to the right people at prospective customers, educate them about LLMs, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You’ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyze market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities, partnerships, and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by pinpointing new customer segments and use cases, collaborating cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings and sustain a competitive edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering custom

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale&#39;s Global Public Sector team is focused on using AI to address critical challenges facing the public sector around the world. As a Staff Applied AI Engineer, you&#39;ll raise the bar for how AI gets built, governed, and evaluated across the team. You&#39;ll define standards that other engineers adopt, such as evaluation methodologies for agents and MLOps practices, while acting as the senior technical voice for the most sensitive AI decisions our clients face.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define standards for responsible AI, model governance, and production MLOps that get adopted broadly across the Global Public Sector team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build or validate the highest-risk parts of strategic AI systems and use those systems to establish standards other teams can adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect AI systems designed to prevent systemic failure, and lead the resolution of the most severe incidents tied to model safety or data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable AI capabilities, such as production-ready agent implementations built on proven architectures, fine-tuned models, or evaluation methodologies, that other engineers and clients can build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on which new AI developments are worth adopting, and help set the technical roadmap for the domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior technical partner to client leadership on AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach Senior Applied AI Engineers, delegate ownership of technical domains, and build systems and practices that enable multiple teams to deliver safer AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to recruiting and representing Scale&#39;s AI work externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive engineering experience, with a multi-year track record owning AI/ML systems in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience judging the quality of training data, selecting the right adaptation method for a given model, evaluating fine-tuning results, and balancing serving cost, latency, and quality trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning an AI-powered product end to end, including direct involvement in the AI&#39;s behaviour rather than implementing ML work scoped by another team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of establishing standards t

&lt;h2&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;De nouveaux modèles, ouverts ou fermés, sortent chaque mois : encore faut-il choisir ceux qui sont assez bons pour la production, et le démontrer. Applications et agents s’appuient sur les grands modèles de langage (LLM), et la partie modèle de ces systèmes est entre vos mains. Nos clients s’en servent pour répondre à leurs propres clients, traiter des documents et interroger leurs connaissances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce que le modèle voit, la manière dont il retrouve les connaissances, les outils qu’il peut appeler : ces choix vous appartiennent, de même que la mesure de la qualité des réponses. Le modèle retenu doit tenir l’objectif de coût et de qualité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce poste est fait pour vous si vous voulez savoir si un système d’IA donne des réponses justes, et pas seulement s’il tourne.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact accompagne les plus grandes entreprises du monde dans le déploiement de l’IA : 3 000 AI makers dans plus de 30 pays, plus de 1 000 clients. En France, le département Engineering réunit environ 300 personnes sous la responsabilité du CTO ; vous y rejoignez le chapter AI Applied Engineer, archétype AI Engineer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Activités et responsabilités&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les Product Engineers construisent l’application autour du modèle ; le comportement du modèle à l’intérieur vous revient. Les Context &amp;amp; Analytics Engineers préparent les connaissances que vos agents retrouvent, et les Platform Engineers exploitent le serving, le harness et l’observabilité sur lesquels vous vous appuyez.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avec l’AI Product Manager et les experts métier du client, une bonne réponse se définit, puis les résultats s’examinent ensemble. La relecture de code entre pairs et l’accompagnement des nouvelles recrues font partie du quotidien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire des applications et des agents LLM : conception du contexte, appel d’outils, workflows multi-étapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir la façon dont les agents exploitent les connaissances : requêtes de retrieval, re-ranking, citations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire des jeux et des pipelines d’évaluation : réponses de référence, scoring automatisé, relecture par des experts métier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre la qualité des réponses en production et corriger ce qui se dégrade.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt

