&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire des applications et des agents LLM : conception du contexte, appel d’outils, workflows multi-étapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir la façon dont les agents exploitent les connaissances : requêtes de retrieval, re-ranking, citations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire des jeux et des pipelines d’évaluation : réponses de référence, scoring automatisé, relecture par des experts métier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre la qualité des réponses en production et corriger ce qui se dégrade.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Typeform is fully remote by design. For this role, we can hire candidates based in the UK, Ireland, Germany, Portugal, Spain or The Netherlands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Paid Marketing Strategist to help us rethink how Typeform approaches paid acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll own and grow key channels including TikTok, YouTube, Google Performance Max and Uber Ads, while helping us test new opportunities across areas such as audio and CTV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a hands on role with real ownership. You’ll manage significant media budgets, build channel strategy, develop campaigns, work closely with our creative teams, and help us understand the true business impact of our investment through MMM, incrementality testing and other measurement approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join the Acquisition team within Marketing and partner closely with Creative, Product Marketing, Data, RevOps and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and day to day performance of key paid social and display channels, including TikTok, YouTube, Google Performance Max and Uber Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a multichannel strategy that helps Typeform reduce its reliance on paid search and find new sources of efficient growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage six figure monthly media budgets, making decisions based on customer acquisition, revenue, CAC and LTV to CAC performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch and optimise campaigns that drive Typeform signups and new paid customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn creative ideas into campaigns by briefing and partnering closely with copywriters and designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent career step if you’re looking for a relocation opportunity to &lt;strong&gt;Germany&lt;/strong&gt;. Right to work in the region and fluent German will be required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a curious, smart, and “learn it all” Architect with proven experience and a passion for designing transformative solution architectures for our prospects and customers. This high-impact role demands a unique blend of deep technical expertise and executive presence, requiring you to confidently present to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;C-level executives&lt;/strong&gt; and translate their strategic goals into actionable technical plans. You will work with technical teams at our prospects and customers to design architectures that drive &lt;strong&gt;enterprise modernization&lt;/strong&gt;, leveraging techniques like &lt;strong&gt;capability mapping&lt;/strong&gt; and exploring innovative solutions with &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary goal is to support our growing sales team in achieving revenue goals by unlocking technical blockers and partnering closely with our Sales, Value Engineering, Product Management, Data Ops, and Information Security teams. You will be responsible for supporting engagements with new prospects as well as existing customers that look to expand their footprint. Measures of success include new customer acquisition rates, retention, up-selling, and contribution to overall sales team and business success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Build and own a self-service, multi-tenant platform that keeps the critical data of 20+ customers recoverable&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you like building platforms that other teams consume, at scale, across private and public clouds, with security and tenant isolation as non-negotiables? At Schuberg Philis, the world is shifting from traditional backup to data security and resilience. We’re looking for a Platform Engineer to strengthen our Data Management-as-a-Service (DMS) team and help us build the next generation of our platform.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The DMS team builds and runs a shared, fully segregated data resilience platform that serves more than 20 of our customers. Customer teams consume it through self-service, and they handle their own day-to-day backup and restore operations. That means you won’t spend your days on job monitoring, restore tickets or backup schedules. Your customers are internal and external engineering teams, and your product is the platform they build on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll join a dedicated group of data security experts within our larger Services Team and work closely with our sbp.cloud team, who operate our self-built sovereign cloud solutions. With our plan-build-run approach, you take end-to-end ownership: you design it, you build it, you run it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Challenge&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Running one platform for 20+ customers means solving the hard problems of platform engineering:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-tenancy by design: strict isolation of data, access, and performance between customers, on shared infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-service at scale: APIs, guardrails and automation that let customer teams onboard and operate independently, without tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and resilience: 4,000+ protected endpoints and more than 25,000 recovery points generated daily, on a dedicated private cloud spanning multiple availability zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heterogeneous workloads: Oracle, MS-SQL, SAP, Sybase, PaaS, container platforms and VMs across VMware VCF, OpenStack, AWS, Azure and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern storage back-ends: public cloud services and S3-compatible object storage built on Pure FlashBlade//S and NetApp StorageGRID in our own datacenters, plus a long-term archiving tier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security first: immutability, segregation and hardening in a highly secure environment where recoverability is the
